dīptānalārka-dyutim aprameyam\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3226,\"bb\":2848,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/17/b2848/\",\"shadow_value\":\"kirīṭinam – with helmets; gadinam – with maces; cakriṇam – with discs; ca – and; tejaḥ-rāśim – effulgence; sarvataḥ – on all sides; dīpti-mantam – glowing; paśyāmi – I see; tvām – You; durnirīkṣyam – difficult to see; samantāt – everywhere; dīpta-anala – blazing fire; arka – of the sun; dyutim – the sunshine; aprameyam – immeasurable.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"kirīṭinam\",\"translation\":\"with helmets\"},{\"word\":\"gadinam\",\"translation\":\"with maces\"},{\"word\":\"cakriṇam\",\"translation\":\"with discs\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"tejaḥ-rāśim\",\"translation\":\"effulgence\"},{\"word\":\"sarvataḥ\",\"translation\":\"on all sides\"},{\"word\":\"dīpti-mantam\",\"translation\":\"glowing\"},{\"word\":\"paśyāmi\",\"translation\":\"I see\"},{\"word\":\"tvām\",\"translation\":\"You\"},{\"word\":\"durnirīkṣyam\",\"translation\":\"difficult to see\"},{\"word\":\"samantāt\",\"translation\":\"everywhere\"},{\"word\":\"dīpta-anala\",\"translation\":\"blazing fire\"},{\"word\":\"arka\",\"translation\":\"of the sun\"},{\"word\":\"dyutim\",\"translation\":\"the sunshine\"},{\"word\":\"aprameyam\",\"translation\":\"immeasurable\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3227,\"bb\":2849,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/17/b2849/\",\"body_value\":\"Your form is difficult to see because of its glaring effulgence, spreading on all sides, like blazing fire or the immeasurable radiance of the sun. Yet I see this glowing form everywhere, adorned with various crowns, clubs and discs.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 11.17\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 11.17\"},\"loca